{"summary":"A forest simulator where you plant trees and click animals to make them poop!","description":"Create your own cozy forest!\n\nPlant Seeds and Watch Them Grow\nExperience the full lifecycle of trees: seed, sapling, adult tree, dead tree and fallen trunk. Each step creates a different habitat for other plants and animals.\n\nFill Your Forest with Animals\nEach animal has specific habitat needs you have to fullfill before adding them. Squirrels need trees, butterflies need flowers etc.\n\nClick Animals to Make Them Poop and More\nClicking on animals trigger different behaviors that influence the forest ecosystem: Moose poop, fertilizing the soil. Voles eat tree roots, damaging the tree. Foxes hunt other animals.\n\nAdapt to the Terrain or Terraform It to Your Needs\nCreate forests in diverse terrains including hills, lakes, mountains, fjords and wetlands. Terraform the terrain if you want even more control.\n\nSurvive Natural Disasters\nForest fires, storms and bark beetle swarms affect the forest in various ways. Can you use them to your advantage and create a thriving ecosystem?","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$5.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4vAaZB8oA8o?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c22IDl7CsBoHb69tQGDw2UvR8mhiAf57OKTSHO3Jlgev9J5D56D8YMz0sWuFJiCckVOZ-kv2EsjOLWJNuI0e","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l9QS8l_9JOE7sgtW7YrKITBYa3fQPWuFxDk93Bc13tZ0pyJelFTomhObKdkqA4AYjrjDr4lbBAdWv1Df2rdQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F323g7zYQXU2ssz-ih4vKMZHekf6BSen7-imd94xdxTCBpxbccsvCktkABLZWCRtGJf702ViGhOGjuwx6fF4hZ4","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hDb5hsJd4SSV7QR82RltS7T1Np8cQyEYaeE2RgIw-j-zlniBIGp2gFUoAfEMHFPN1Dn4wg8Lyg9NprDDr7TyHA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/p-EaluwNpcC026X9BJIoaVeZevCNKFsBPUavwlSgc_5fwapp5mqZih9w3ZnLpyeoqi6JK3Y7IXC_jAsyGBCp","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AX6lxb0_f9GK4AqWsrf1JKN62pNAWLq2GO-s8-u7WeSBsaV